## ==========================================
## Genealogy data
## ==========================================
# Real family trees contain living people's details; keep them out of git.
*.ged
# ...except the test fixture, which is committed on purpose. Because it is
# re-included here, it is never ignored: new copies can be added normally and
# changes to it always show up in git status.
!FamilyTreeTest.ged

